  "id": "growth-motivation",
  "term": "growth motivation",
  "definition": "Growth motivation is a person’s drive to develop themselves and move toward further personal growth. In this packet, it is discussed in terms of personal growth initiative and is linked to having basic psychological needs met, along with positive psychological resources and a future-oriented outlook.",
